        "text": "Could you tell me what you want from me\nWhile your living this life worry free\nIs there anything theft incomplete\nDon't tell me that all this freedom is vein\n \nIn these lies\ncould there really be a perfect life\nFor the things I've had to sacrifice\nOr is all this freedom in vein\n \nStanding on the side line\nwaiting for the empty round\nPulling on the trigger\nthe guns don't make a sound\nFeeling like killer\nmy country says to cut them down\nScreamin that I'm sorry\neverybody's falling down\n \nI do all that you want\ntake the fall take a shot for you\nNothing that you feed me\nhas ever been too much to chew\nMiss out on my sons life\nlose my wife its nothing new\nGiving you the good life\nwhat else can you put me through\n \nCould you tell me what you want from me\nWhile your living this life worry free\nIs there anything theft incomplete\nDon't tell me that all this freedom is vein\n \nIn these lies\ncould there really be a perfect life\nFor the things I've had to sacrifice\nOr is all this freedom in vein"
