        "text": "Winds of change outside my door.\nThat thing we once had known,\ncan you see it anymore?\nLies our people now adore.\nHiding what ought to be shown,\nwinds of change outside my door.\nWithin the winds as myth, and lore.\nThe seeds we once had sown,\nCan you see it anymore?.\nA raging endless war.\nThe purpose is unknown,\nWinds of change outside my door\nHowling never more.\nWinds of change have blown,\ncan you see it anymore?\nHowling forever never more.\nOur seeds not to be grown.\nwinds of change outside my door, \ncan you see it anymore?\n \n  "
