      {
        "title": "When the lights go out",
        "date": "December 12, 2015",
        "text": "Each night I try to hold you,\nbut there is no one there holding onto me.\nEverything I try just won't do,\nanother day undone by things I can't see.\nThat's a clever disguise, \nfools me every time.\nThe silence you use to hide the lie that's behind,\nthose eyes.\n \nIf you didn't want to talk about it,\nthen there was nothing for us to talk about.\nAnd now you've got me thinking about it,\nI can't get through to you when you turn around.\n \nI guess if you don't want to talk about it,\nthen there is nothing left to talk about.\nI'll try to sleep not thinking about it.\nIts like there's no one there when the lights go out.\nIts like there's no one there when the lights go out.\n \nEvery word you breathe is poison, \nand each breath you draw, like blades into me.\nYou know just where to hold them,\nso I can never come up off of my knees.\nThat's a clever disguise, \nfools me every time.\nThe anger you use to hide the truth that's behind,\nthose eyes.\n \nIf you don't want to talk about it,\nthen there is nothing left to talk about.\nIts been so long since I thought about it,\nif its the same to you I'll just turn around.\n \nBecause if you don't want to talk about it,\nthen there is nothing left to shout about.\nI've been sleeping just fine not thinking about it.\nIt isn't me you're seeing when the lights go out.\nIt isn't me you're seeing when the lights go out.\n \nNow its your choice to be chosen,\nI find it funny how it's you leaving me.\nEvery door I opened, close them,\nshut the last one just before you leave.\nThat's a clever disguise, \nfools me every time.\nThe knowledge you use to hide the fear that's behind,\nthose eyes.\n \nYou won't see me cry about it,\nbecause there is nothing left to cry about.\nMy eyes dry up just thinking about it,\nwalk the other way, don't ever turn around.\n \nYou don't have to scream about it!\nbecause there is nothing left to scream about.\nI like to tell myself you never thought about it.\nThat makes it easy to take when the lights go out\nThat makes it easy to take when the lights go out. "
      }
